{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56367","headline":"闲游赋附长歌 · 徐魁","name":"闲游赋附长歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上幽岫兮得所钦，山蔬尘兮桂酒斟，嗟草木兮洛（疑）春心，悼日月兮游（疑）相寻，贵龙凤兮就高深，悦张邴兮托萧森。\n（见《文苑英华》卷一二七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐魁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}